  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:689250aa889db496af7a1c0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你是跳级进入特雷森学园就读的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8970f12dc2ba9ef2c85066b92e2f3ff28c1cb318e037d899b69dd6c7a6232bfa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22c39c5c5edf1f5a03a2c744",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长的料理是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfe692632ac63b38fa3d6c2f34092e1eed2147af327202c082420d3cae29d686",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "153"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54597f6e562e068a78e94bc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛前的致胜料理吃了什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "977ce0c7615a51c57dff528bc9bedf1dc33650d36215b553d98df2851f2f32aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9ce2a2efff05658012cb4c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简单来说，竞赛的妙趣是！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ab02b88c8533f76d597c19df02b6e9dda30ea8b87451a461420899e4969649f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ab89e9053d99d97f88a21b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "都做了些怎么样的特训呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a329e535fe19cab12bfe1896d07ed624b509eeeca34fa90ac3649816456bf6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be2735ff69fd068dc7c0734",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7321329fe7053537673a27efce5d83991630f035a40f049626407139a041be58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811beeed491ea564f15b20d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你被称为魔鬼纠察队长，原因是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da115032d343211c4773a2614fcac0704f8d9effefca336e8675d4b050a466c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a338f54c1097be81418855",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你尊敬的对象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2841363d27d91818cab85659b522e2ca44345f5f819f49075cbc463293dfa3bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f407cbfa4bedb3d733b75a51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉大家你平常会特别留心的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d235a7f932dba4bf206f15546842044785e90d5f24fb543cc62fc3d61f8648",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9983d346833c35fb88745ea6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "意気込みをお願いします。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63c2ae9ca096e74b507a7747fd64aa2423e0b5670722295aa1121282e68b85ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8907f683520d4787c8940f29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尊敬する人物を教えてください。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aad0c8a05e0026b3905ba528d8d2907b4043d8193d233cde9e10188bc92bb56a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ebaff985d80554ca6f640e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本日のレース、1着を取れそうですか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b065254fec691008e76dbd9a1401f8ec89ed82596a367b2156a33817d25cfe7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3266400e134128983877a04e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对比赛是否已经准备周全了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a6b4bc9f27dcb3887c0069531795f09520e036769bee7e35e63b89a336c9995",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c814ec718a1191b5dedb81ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近发现的美丽是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd0f8a053c940ce847ea76a61f59da29dc9efad64b60ba56876c6409dcfb137",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488c6e7a844984cedfe71be5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对劲敌们说句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11401d7d8cf45808fd9d38609086d2370f08da824e43b6a3415b10e213852e85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3abafe5449761ce8865cfedb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有多少把握……不，有多少运气？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6afe40e0bd50f6dec30bd1e2d073b73d8b89eb98a44ad6145637605be5a4bf4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:936c53cb8b50d14e338ad4d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然很突然，可以请你帮我占卜一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "66d245592203f602e5337fec7bb4d32d91b2c4037ac78631d7c1b00225ff8339",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae14f6a5f62ea0a3a47a4e00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "福气会降临吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a05348f715b06713a5fa1bb2ef23e007c7ec9320bbb040768a514f440a398ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f093bf3cb6088d9a655b2ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你在比赛前的期许。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d4ccfb0772d6fb67359d87bc1a0ba63e6d05f8de6ef734b1db43d11be67faa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56d505b8999244d4876290f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "曾因为环境改变而感到困扰吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab387f2dd86b90c0c5dcc31fcaa8b2168cc3edccbe838f890c9e9ebb58a7d75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae0116c4e3620a988c96d49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场比赛有很多位强者喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84293ddf08d5a1e4586d900dc94ddc8cb16e1c50effcd19842aface040391f45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d85740a5445dd36384a8b08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你看起来心情非常好，遇上什么好事了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15705a70c8e2ec129b061b064bca2c6814f5f67d0b2cde861807d66055ef60c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33d5a56d846a96966e0fbe3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说抱负──呃，还好吗？你脸色有点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "371cff6facd734922f540fa772410d778e29c9a3305278dac5ec25bba66c0160",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc495c550fcc87964f427d6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你当作目标的对象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd065493ad700887062846739f4a5483cbdac9c49891ab6235c3a1967a486b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0221d64b135eb127597104a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简单来说，胜利的秘诀是！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff3d96bbce3120a567d96bf3ae2ad18e24a9b575869dce9c246816b2b26a51a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8c498b0c76c27075c865b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好像有什么很香的味道？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ee03c12b1548c9f79f0fa872901f7196bf30d1940b29f6f57a35780306d842",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235dd7623046f419ab46fd6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "家人是不是都会叫你「小多」之类的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c63cc737a969b6b3f0399ef0351ba13cbe1b4c417a80178eb9a5462678658cff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c81a5026250ebf3ceb6b771",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1398b3629ec121af8bef36cb0d63fda7a0ddfc5fdf5ca6d5c069bc57053bd1cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:475ece6081cef8df90f6f7fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你常看电视购物节目，最近有推荐的节目吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a818539d5b589a03f412535c0ac4ed8234cc0c90cb9cfc9821ff8a4d40b6ae4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed3253dab8e0ce3f93068e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请用福冈腔说说抱负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfdd53bda620cc463cae579dd6ab0ad0d64b3035e07b8889cf54c07eb4802828",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5521dbc8508d8b38e6f97862",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛获胜后，最想先做什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5787b942deaeba8c22d4b163986d529c5d8e8c784bc3748175ebab6335032f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e05ac82f87f653050ffc065f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待你能拿出安定感非凡的表现纵横赛场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07c3b87883ac1e9e7e574fc4e322c9c03474f31808e081bd173c05b4da82d687",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d361261e185244e6c5750ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "针对竞赛做了多少跑步训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9897adb7b91482892537c91de7ad8363625284939dae0181f2f9c2afd871622",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3c032caec9101be19a719b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近有遇到什么失误吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45bef4fc162d8dba4f1d45c120193a69c2d072eadbd0ee86be7228f3f7a2c397",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ddb58836c04b4ca62bbc19",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有竞赛和训练的日子都怎么度过？",
      "source_fingerprint": "983491826807b4f382b0c40de8281498dea0c3870d05ec066c4325f8f0c6a58a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81859b5e19cc210a87e9d960",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对支持你的粉丝说句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5a9a2f814783e93d18d5e700918a58315f57dbc941972f0d027258e78fcdb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dd3c3910d46da910b43df12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛前的致胜料理吃了什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "977ce0c7615a51c57dff528bc9bedf1dc33650d36215b553d98df2851f2f32aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df4a7b230dc5ca8bc16ee65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们这次的秘密策略！",
      "source_fingerprint": "683b41ef7e38ecc3e6b41ed3600d4c3df16e31fb1effa512773546e3ef826ce9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed725d663b614535e40bbcbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "除了跑步以外，还热衷于什么吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2faf5a43dc845c86e2b79b45fe7225e2e97d5de76ade729384278f08fc5ba7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb30a58da1aba7d48bad291e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "针对这次的比赛，做了多少跑步训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "71efe3a174db6fdcdc77e43744c4d0eff341de844bb3f879b792a15850bcbc23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6783db71ed5b5bb82cc6a2d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听见粉丝的声援，有什么感想吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "118edecc7999f4ee934dedf2548120af5c92a723404dcf786a3d605cb0be3c5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:134fa298a7555f3e07730d35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对家人说几句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "678a22e5b71e394baf9c25302c8dcdb80d2283754d77232844d65ded34767b06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6039a79df6107f67885a6ce6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场竞赛备受瞩目，你觉得有把握吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc13f680cb3f6c07b475749d15867f0597d85e8021ea96aeebdec88b1e1d448a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c477c92b0225a7767bac0ce7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会展现帝王舞步给我们看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa17a0f135a537aec28eb9987affc25e8e3683b5dacc4494d779365837712280",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6769863cea9a431a943be600",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天也有喝蜂蜜特饮吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e5b1c10fee84ec08aaa07655e9577a14cbbc1b2dd1bd3ffc464d28343b69a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19d159a3a32e1af194e08f97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "透过每日训练有什么发现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "158508bde08f033576c576870118b298918084c06ffc9eb7c8238dd346e5190b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:546fb90a98d387f8ac261ead",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以用一句话来形容现在的状态吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0af936a38636e00bea46c99770f515b89e07439a333d6ff46cf5e7d7298323f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27c4880197246f64920394d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对你而言的最佳表现是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b312c3d3a527bb9c3bed477b62e3cb2f384f9ebcc23b7751c411e143dfbaf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf092530325c1cb825db6a2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近栗东宿舍有发生什么事情吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "161965b5705fb960791b878b18957117ac4dc6bb40e808fce17b5458f5e352fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f0b30d78bb3120364faf06",
      "kind": "text_data",
